[
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 1,
    "text": "[…And I said, “O LORD, I have seen many from Israel who loved] your name.”",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109609"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 2,
    "text": "[They walked in the paths of your heart. When will these things happen, and h]ow will their loyalty be repaid?",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109618"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 3,
    "text": "[…And the LORD said to me, “I will show] the children of Israel, and they will know”",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i799786"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 4,
    "text": "[“that I am the LORD.” … He said, “Son of man, prophe]sy over the bones.”",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109636"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 5,
    "text": "[“And say: ‘Let bone draw near to bone, and joint to] joint.’ And it happened …",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109646"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 6,
    "text": "[So it happened. And he said again: ‘Prophesy, and sine]ws will rise upon them, and skin will cover them …",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109655"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 7,
    "text": "[…over them from above; skin formed, and sine]ws came upon them …",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109664"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 8,
    "text": "[There was no breath in them. He said to me again: ‘Prophesy] over the four winds …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109671"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "verse": 9,
    "text": "[…of heaven, and let them breathe upon them; they stood on their feet, a] great multitude of people …",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109609-i109681"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 1,
    "text": "[…the land, and they will know that I am the LORD …] He said to me: ‘Look!’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109690"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 2,
    "text": "‘Son of man, [look] at the land of Israel.’ I said: ‘O LORD, behold, it is desolate.’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109699"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 3,
    "text": "‘And when will you gather them?’ The LORD said: ‘A worthless man plans to oppress my people …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109708"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 4,
    "text": "‘I will not let him [prevail] … his offspring will not remain, and the impure seed will not survive …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109718"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 5,
    "text": "‘…no grape-yield will come from [the broken word], nor will [it] produce honey … and …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109729"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 6,
    "text": "‘I will kill the wicked one in Memphis, bring my sons out of Memphis, and … the remnant …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109739"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 7,
    "text": "‘…as they say, “Let there be peace and prosperity.” They will say: “May the land become …”’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109749"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 8,
    "text": "‘…as it was in former days. Thus I will stir up my anger against them …’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109757"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "verse": 9,
    "text": "‘…from the four winds of heaven … [the rest is too broken to translate reliably].’",
    "sourceUrl": "https://lexicon.qumran-digital.org/transcriptions/4Q386/2026-10-06/index.html?v=2026-10-06#c109690-i109766"
